// CreatureOpponentControls = "each creature an opponent controls" — the
// symmetric-anthem counterpart to `OtherCreatureYouControl` (a debuff over
// the opposing team rather than a boost over your own). A Selection-kind
// macro: the whole `SelectAll(...)` IS the macro body, so a card spells it as
// `Each(CreatureOpponentControls, Modify(It, <change>))` directly.
(
    name: "CreatureOpponentControls",
    template: "each creature an opponent controls",
    kinds: [Selection],
    body: SelectAll(AllOf([Creature, ControlledBy(OpponentOf(Ref(You)))])),
)
